  "limitations": [
    "the benchmark was not captured with locked clocks",
    "the benchmark is batch-one and covers two short 19-token prompts with two output tokens",
    "the mirrored same-binary command order reduces ordering bias but is not a randomized trial",
    "the result does not establish large-prefill throughput; the measured prompt prefix contains one full C16 tile and a two-token tail",
    "the result does not establish continuous-batching throughput or concurrent-request behavior",
    "the Tensor Core path is limited to the listed exact FP8 and NVFP4 M16 shapes; other M16 shapes retain the two-M8 fallback",
    "the raw benchmark logs and Nsight report are local evidence and are not checked into the repository",
    "cudaMemGetInfo request-arena size is a planned allocation, not a process peak-memory trace",
    "the default C1 prefill policy and reference projection backend are unchanged"
  ],
